rel 1A for a straightforward individual study setup near Lilly’s music collections; the library lists it as study space without audio equipment.","short_summary":"A named individual carrel in the music library.","evidence_claim":"Lilly Music Library identifies Study Carrel 1A as study space only, without equipment.","source_url":"https://tischlibrary.tufts.edu/our-locations/tisch-branches/music-library/audiovisual-equipment","source_title":"Audiovisual Equipment | Tisch Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Lilly Music Library is in Granoff Music Center, Room M030; check its current hours before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"tufts-ginn-third-floor-stacks-silent-study-area","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Ginn Library Third Floor Stacks Silent Study Area","title":"Ginn Third Floor Stacks","subtitle":"Ginn Library, Mugar Hall","notes":"Head to the Third Floor Stacks for independent, silent work; keep phones silent and move calls elsewhere, as Ginn’s rules specify.","short_summary":"Ginn’s designated silent-study area among the third-floor stacks.","evidence_claim":"Ginn Library designates its Third Floor Stacks as a silent-study area for silent, independent study only.","source_url":"https://ginnlibrary.tufts.edu/what-we-have/spaces/studying-library","source_title":"Studying in the Library | Ginn Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"No food; covered drinks are permitted. Keep cell phones silent and do not make voice calls.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"tufts-joyce-cummings-center-study-spaces","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Joyce Cummings Center","title":"Joyce Cummings Center","subtitle":"177 College Avenue, Medford","notes":"Use the building’s study spaces between classes and confirm access before you go; it also includes computer labs, printing, kitchenettes, and accessible bathrooms.","short_summary":"An academic building with study spaces and practical workday amenities.","evidence_claim":"Tufts states that the Joyce Cummings Center houses academic departments, research laboratories, study spaces, computer labs, and a JumboPrint station.","source_url":"https://access.tufts.edu/joyce-cummings-center-jcc","source_title":"Joyce Cummings Center (JCC) | Access Tufts","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Semester building access is generally Mon–Thu 8am–1am, Fri 8am–8pm, and weekends 10am–8pm or 1am; hours can vary.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
